claim.claim-text:
a base layer (12) having an upper surface (15), a forefoot portion, a midfoot portion, and a heel portion; and
an upper layer (14), formed of a polymer material;
wherein the upper layer (14) is directly bonded to the base layer (12) in each of the forefoot portion, the midfoot portion, and the heel portion without any fastening members, adhesive, stitching or any other separate fastening members that secure the upper layer (14) to the base layer (12);
wherein the upper surface (15) of the base layer (12) has a first portion (15A) that is covered by the upper layer (14), and a second portion (15B) that is not covered by the upper layer (14), wherein the second portion (15B) of the base layer (12) is exposed;
wherein the second portion (15B) extends about an entire outer perimeter of the base layer (12) and defines a peripheral flange for securing the strobel (10) to an upper of an article of footwear;
wherein the base layer (12) has a central aperture extending therethrough; and
wherein the polymer material is disposed within the central aperture.
